{
  "_README": [
    "JarCube DEMO bot flow — exercises every NodeTypeEnum value.",
    "Load with: PATCH /bots/:botId/flow   body = { nodes, edges, customAttributes }",
    "BotFlowNode.id has a UNIQUE index across ALL bots, so load this file into ONE bot only.",
    "Replace every REPLACE_ME_* placeholder with a real id from your environment before loading,",
    "otherwise WEBHOOK / ADD_TO_SEGMENT / REMOVE_FROM_SEGMENT / OPEN_TEMPLATE take their failure route.",
    "Runtime traversal uses BotFlowNode.next[], which BotsService.createNodes() derives from edges[].",
    "startNode is derived by the service from the node whose nodeType is START_NODE."
  ],
  "customAttributes": [
    "lead_name",
    "lead_email",
    "lead_phone",
    "lead_city",
    "issue_description",
    "issue_attachment",
    "ticket_summary",
    "ticket_evidence"
